"text":"பொலி","lemma":"poli","gloss":"shining"}],"gloss":"shining"},{"surface":"மகடூஉ","parts":[{"text":"மகடூஉ","lemma":"makaṭūu","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"woman"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"சிற்சில்","parts":[{"text":"சில்","lemma":"cil","gloss":"few"},{"text":"சில்","lemma":"cil","gloss":"few"}],"gloss":"very little"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரிசையின்","parts":[{"text":"வரிசை","lemma":"varicai","gloss":"order/status"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"according to"}],"gloss":"according to status"},{"surface":"அளக்கவும்","parts":[{"text":"அள","lemma":"aḷa","gloss":"measure"},{"text":"க்க","lemma":"kka","gloss":"infinitive marker"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"to measure also"},{"surface":"வல்லன்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"capable"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"capable man"},{"surface":"உரிதினின்","parts":[{"text":"உரிது","lemma":"uritu","gloss":"right"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"oblique"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"rightfully"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காவல்","parts":[{"text":"காவல்","lemma":"kāval","gloss":"protecting"}],"gloss":"protecting"},{"surface":"மன்னர்","parts":[{"text":"மன்னர்","lemma":"maṉṉar","gloss":"kings"}],"gloss":"kings"},{"surface":"கடை","parts":[{"text":"கடை","lemma":"kaṭai","gloss":"gate"}],"gloss":"gate"},{"surface":"முகத்து","parts":[{"text":"முகத்து","lemma":"முகத்து","gloss":"at the front"}],"gloss":"at the front","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உகுக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"உகுக்கும்","lemma":"உகுக்கும்","gloss":"spilling"}],"gloss":"spilling","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"போகு","parts":[{"text":"போகு","lemma":"pōku","gloss":"going/offered"}],"gloss":"offered"},{"surface":"பலி","parts":[{"text":"பலி","lemma":"pali","gloss":"sacrifice/offering"}],"gloss":"offering"},{"surface":"வெண்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்","lemma":"வெண்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சோறு","parts":[{"text":"சோறு","lemma":"cōṟu","gloss":"rice"}],"gloss":"rice"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தூவவும்","parts":[{"text":"தூவு","lemma":"tūvu","gloss":"scatter"},{"text":"அவும்","lemma":"avum","gloss":"to also"}],"gloss":"to scatter also"},{"surface":"வல்லன்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"capable"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"capable man"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"தூவும்","parts":[{"text":"தூவு","lemma":"tūvu","gloss":"scatter"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"scattering"},{"surface":"காலே","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"kāl","gloss":"time"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"time indeed"}]}],"literal":"Stone-cut made strong brackish well / bow-plow life small-village strong-man / very-much became-poor although, cold much-increasing / dim evening small fire kindling / unlearned shepherd like, by intent / that-which-is-not to-create-also capable-he, that-which-is-there / very small although, 'many-people' saying-not / long tall canopy food order feeding / house-shining woman like, very-little / by-status to-measure-also capable-he; rightfully / protecting kings gate-front spilling / going-offering white-rice like / to-scatter-also capable-he, he scattering time-indeed.","translation":"The strongman of the small village, whose livelihood is the bow and whose well is cut into stone with brackish water, is extremely poor. Yet, like an unlettered shepherd kindling a small fire in the cold, desolate evening, he is capable of creating something out of nothing when needed. When he has only a very little, like a noble housewife who feeds many guests under a long canopy without complaining, he can measure out and distribute even the smallest portions with dignity. And when he has abundance, he is capable of scattering it generously, like the white sacrificial rice scattered at the gates of protective kings.","modern":"கல்லில் வெட்டிச் செய்யப்பட்ட உவர்நீர் கிணற்றையும், வில்லையே தொழிலாகக் கொண்ட வாழ்க்கையையும் உடைய சிற்றூரின் வலிமைமிக்க தலைவன் வறுமையில் வாடினாலும், பனி மிகுந்த மாலைப் பொழுதில் சிறு நெருப்பை மூட்டும் அறிவில்லாத இடையனைப் போல, தன் குறிப்பினால் இல்லாததையும் உண்டாக்க வல்லவன் ஆவான். தன்னிடம் இருப்பது மிகச் சிறிதே என்றாலும், வந்திருப்பவர் பலர் என்று எண்ணாமல், பெரிய பந்தலின் கீழ் வரிசைப்படி உணவளிக்கும் இல்லத்தரசியைப் போல, இருக்கும் சிறிதளவையும் பகுத்து அளந்து கொடுக்க வல்லவன். தன்னிடம் பொருள் இருக்கும் காலத்திலோ, காவல் புரியும் மன்னர்களின் வாயிலில் தூவப்படும் பலிச்சோற்றைப் போல, வாரி வழங்கவும் வல்லவன் ஆவான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and Mūtiṉ Mullai tuṟai, which celebrates the ancient, brave warrior families. The poet, Uṟaiyūr Mutukūttaṉār, praises a poor warrior of a small forest village. He describes how the warrior manages his resources under different circumstances. When he has nothing, he can conjure up hospitality out of thin air, like a shepherd lighting a fire in the cold. When he has very little, he distributes it carefully and gracefully, like a housewife feeding guests. When he has plenty, he scatters his wealth as generously as sacrificial rice at a king's gate. The imagery of the brackish well, the shepherd, and the housewife beautifully illustrates the warrior's noble character and adaptability.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.78],[1.78,2.02],[2.02,2.68],[2.68,3.25],[3.25,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,4.7],[4.7,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.71],[6.71,7.19],[7.19,7.56],[7.56,7.85],[7.85,8.18],[8.18,8.44],[8.44,8.77],[8.77,9.02],[9.6,10.3],[10.3,11.2],[11.2,11.63],[11.63,11.8],[11.8,12.6],[12.6,13.65],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.7],[14.7,15.32],[15.32,15.88],[15.88,16.33],[16.44,16.9],[16.9,17.3],[18.04,18.74],[18.74,19.27],[19.27,19.74],[19.74,20.04],[20.04,21.24